*.log

# Build artifacts
**/PrecompiledWeb/

# Runtime fallback data folder (auto-created when App_Data is not writable)
**/SiteData/

# Panel auth ticket key (per-install secret, never commit)
**/panel-ticket.key

# Local upload packages
/*.zip

# Runtime data: never version credentials or visit stats
# (recreated on the host at runtime via App_Code/DataDir seeding)
**/App_Data/panel-users.xml
**/App_Data/site-visits.xml
**/App_Data/site-studio.xml
**/App_Data/media/
**/SiteStudio/
/App_Data/
